4: Useless leading backslash of `\true`, because `true`, `false` and `null` are the same in every namespace.
5: Useless leading backslash of `\FALSE`, because `true`, `false` and `null` are the same in every namespace.
6: Useless leading backslash of `\null`, because `true`, `false` and `null` are the same in every namespace.
